    "description": "Worked with clients in various industries to implement custom business solutions, thereby helping them improve their bottom line.\nWorked in a team environment as a project lead and point of contact.\nUsing SQL Server, MSDE, Microsoft Access (JET), and Oracle, created relation database systems to promote reliability and accuracy of different companies' business data.\nUsing VB 6.0 and ADO created front end applications that would interact with a database back end to store and maintain vital business data for various corporations.\nWrote Windows System Service applications using VB .NET to grab XML data from various alarm sensors and inserted them into a SQL database for storage and reporting.\nWrote a number of ASP and ASP .NET web applications and Windows applications using C#, ADO, ADO .NET, Java Script, VB Script, VB .NET, VB 6.0, Web Services, SQL Server 2000, MSDE and Oracle.; Created a Microsoft Access application that used and MSDE back end to update and maintain data related to condominiums, such as current owner information, monthly payments, due dates, etc. also created various reports using Access.\nUsed Microsoft Office products to create small data driven documents and spread sheets.\nSetup Microsoft Access security and trained people to manage user rights to restrict access to an Access application database.\nTrained client employees on how to use various Microsoft products, including Word, Excel, Access, Outlook, and SQL Server.\nUsed Crystal Reports to create various reports that were integrated into both windows and web applications.",
